  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Measures I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action aims to reinforce the efficiency of the EU cooperation and of the&#xbf;Team Europe&#xbf; approach in the country; promote JWF strategic objectives; and enhance EU&#xbf;s strategic communication and public diplomacy&amp;nbsp;by complementing and providing added value to the implementation of cooperation programmes and Joint Way Forward&#xbf;s objectives and by creating synergies and disseminating information and visibility about EU&#xbf;s action in Angola and EU&#xbf;s multilateral agenda.This action will contribute to the successful preparation, implementation and visibility of development cooperation between the European Union and Angola and foster a more coherent and informed approach to policy dialogue and to development cooperation. Furthermore, it&amp;nbsp;falls within the context of the abolition of the National Authorizing Officer (NAO), as provided for in the provisions of the NDICI-GE, and of the new relations to be developed between the EU and Angola on the basis of an enhanced strategic dialogue.</narrative>
  </description>
